WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.050
Standing light kick deliberately misses after the prerequisite uppercut.

2
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.950
Standing medium punch catches Ryu’s wake-up and links to back heavy.

3
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.500
Heavy knee and the actual medium-punch uppercut finish the juggle.
